Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.60,0:00:02.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,A company has a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.68,0:00:05.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,Somewhere among a thousand researchers,\None person can solve it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.80,0:00:07.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Finding a name is easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.84,0:00:09.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,Being right is not.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.74,0:00:11.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,I am Asso, from SYSTASYS.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.74,0:00:13.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is EINSTEIN Matchmaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.24,0:00:18.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Four agents read the same challenge at the\Nsame time, on one model running on our own
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.00,0:00:19.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.84,0:00:21.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,No hosted API.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.10,0:00:22.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,No key.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.12,0:00:23.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,Nothing is sent to anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.92,0:00:26.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,Two of them think at the very same\Ninstant.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.00,0:00:29.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,You do not have to take my word for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.40,0:00:33.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,The inference server records which of its\Nslots are busy, all the way through.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.62,0:00:37.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,Five thousand of the nearly eight thousand\Nsamples show two slots working at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.02,0:00:40.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,Sixty three percent of the compute.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.10,0:00:44.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,Then an independent critic reads the\Nproposal, and the sources under it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.22,0:00:49.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,Every claim has to quote a field, with its\Nrecord hash and a link into the\Norganizer's
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.30,0:00:53.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,own dataset. When the evidence is thin,\Nthe system says no.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.56,0:00:54.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,Out loud, with a reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.72,0:00:59.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,In the verified block, two proposals were\Naccepted.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.60,0:01:01.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,One was refused on the evidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.70,0:01:03.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Three ran out of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.44,0:01:07.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,We count those three apart, because a case\Nthat ends on the clock has said nothing\Nabout
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.66,0:01:12.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,its sources. We do not claim that four\Nagents answer better than one.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.52,0:01:18.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,There is no answer key for these\Nchallenges, so that question stays open,\Nand the repository
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.36,0:01:19.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,says so in its first table.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.88,0:01:24.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,A system that cannot refuse cannot be\Ntrusted when it accepts.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.44,0:01:25.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,EINSTEIN Matchmaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.02,0:01:30.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,The code, the traces and the verdicts are\Nall in the repository.
